{
  "title": "Budgets / Cost Explorer · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "예산 경고와 비용 분석 도구다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Budgets / Cost Explorer</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-cost-explorer\">AWS Cost Explorer</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-budgets\">AWS Budgets</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#budget-actions\">Budget Actions</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#cost-allocation-tags-and-cost-categories\">Cost Allocation Tags and Cost Categories</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#data-exports-and-cost-and-usage-reports\">Data Exports and Cost and Usage Reports</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#cost-anomaly-detection\">Cost Anomaly Detection</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#compute-optimizer-and-right-sizing\">Compute Optimizer and Right Sizing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#commitments-and-total-cost\">Commitments and Total Cost</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>운영·비용</span><span>07 / 62</span></div><h1>Budgets / Cost Explorer</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 8 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-cost-explorer\">Cost Explorer</a>는 과거·예상 비용을 분석하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-budgets\">AWS Budgets</a>는 예산·사용·약정 지표가 설정 범위를 넘을 때 알린다. 둘 다 Billing 데이터의 갱신 지연을 고려해야 한다.</p><p>총비용은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 실행비뿐 아니라 Storage·Request·Data Transfer·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>·Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>·License·운영 비용을 포함한다. 단가 할인과 불필요한 사용 제거를 함께 검토한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"분석과 예산 대응\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>분석과 예산 대응</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Analysis</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Billing usage data</strong><small>Service·Account·Tag</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-cost-explorer\">Cost Explorer</a></strong><small>추세·원인·Forecast</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Optimization</strong><small>Right Sizing·약정·Storage</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Budget response</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Budget threshold</strong><small>Actual·Forecast 조건</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Alert / Budget Action</strong><small>알림·지원 Action</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Review</strong><small>데이터 갱신 지연 고려</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Budget Alert는 자동 자원 중지나 엄격한 실시간 지출 상한이 아니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aws-cost-explorer\"><h2>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Cost Explorer<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-cost-explorer\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Service·Account·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·Tag 등으로 비용·사용을 Group·Filter한다. Forecast와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>·RI 분석을 참고할 수 있다. 비용 증가 원인을 찾으려면 사용량 변화와 가격·구매 모델 변화를 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aws-budgets\"><h2>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Budgets<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-budgets\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>Cost·Usage·RI·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a> 관련 예산과 Alert를 설정한다. Actual·Forecast 기준을 선택하고 수신 경로를 관리한다. Alert만으로 실행 중인 리소스가 자동 중지되지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"budget-actions\"><h2>Budget Actions<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#budget-actions\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>지원 조건에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a> 적용이나 일부 리소스 제어 같은 Action을 설정할 수 있다. 실행 권한·승인 모델·영향 범위를 검토한다. Billing 지연 때문에 엄격한 실시간 지출 상한으로 사용하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cost-allocation-tags-and-cost-categories\"><h2>Cost Allocation Tags and Cost Categories<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#cost-allocation-tags-and-cost-categories\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Tag를 활성화하여 Team·Project별 비용을 나누고 Cost Category로 규칙 기반 분류를 구성한다. Tag 누락·공유 비용의 배분 규칙을 관리한다. 리소스 Tag 생성과 Billing Tag 활성화는 별도 절차다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"data-exports-and-cost-and-usage-reports\"><h2>Data Exports and Cost and Usage Reports<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#data-exports-and-cost-and-usage-reports\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>상세 Billing 데이터를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 내보내 SQL·BI로 분석할 수 있다. 현재 Data Exports와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#data-exports-and-cost-and-usage-reports\">CUR 2.0</a> 등 지원 형식을 비교한다. 데이터가 크므로 Partition·Query Scan 비용과 접근 권한을 설계한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cost-anomaly-detection\"><h2>Cost Anomaly Detection<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#cost-anomaly-detection\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>기대 패턴에서 벗어난 비용 이상을 탐지하고 알린다. 정해진 Budget Threshold와 다른 목적이다. 탐지 뒤 어느 Service·Account·Usage Type이 원인인지 조사한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"compute-optimizer-and-right-sizing\"><h2>Compute Optimizer and Right Sizing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#compute-optimizer-and-right-sizing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Metric으로 Instance·Volume 등 Resource 추천을 제공한다. Memory 수집과 Workload Peak·SLA를 함께 검토한다. 추천을 그대로 적용하기보다 실제 성능·License·변동 수요를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"commitments-and-total-cost\"><h2>Commitments and Total Cost<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#commitments-and-total-cost\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>·RI는 안정적인 사용 기반에 적용하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a>은 중단 가능한 작업에 비교한다. 미사용 약정·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 처리·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 간 전송·Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 비용이 절감 효과를 상쇄할 수 있다. Pricing Calculator로 예상하고 실제 Billing으로 검증한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Team Tag로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-cost-explorer\">Cost Explorer</a>를 분석하고 월 예산 Alert를 설정한다. 24시간 기본 사용량만 약정하고 Burst는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-Demand</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a>으로 처리하는 비용 모델을 비교한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>예산 알림만 설정했다고 자원이 자동으로 중지되는 것은 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cost-management/latest/userguide/ce-what-is.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cost-management/latest/userguide/ce-what-is.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cost-management/latest/userguide/budgets-managing-costs.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cost-management/latest/userguide/budgets-managing-costs.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q004\" data-question=\"Q004\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q004</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Cost optimization and reliability requirements appear to conflict. What is the best architectural decision?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Increase only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Evaluate business RPO and RTO requirements alongside cost</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Replicate every system across multiple Regions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Always choose the least expensive single-AZ deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a>는 여러 기둥의 요구와 균형을 함께 평가한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q035\" data-question=\"Q035\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q035</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q035/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a stable level of compute usage over a long period. Which commitment-based option can reduce costs compared with On-Demand usage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q035\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q035\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q035\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q035\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 일정 사용량 약정과 교환해 할인한다. 약정 범위와 유형은 사용 패턴에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q080\" data-question=\"Q080\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q080</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q080/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs an alert when its monthly AWS cost approaches a planned threshold. What should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q080\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q080\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Budgets</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q080\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q080\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-budgets\">Budgets</a>는 예산 임계값과 실제·예측 비용 알림에 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q081\" data-question=\"Q081\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q081</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q081/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to analyze whether NAT gateways or data transfer caused a cost increase over time. Which tool is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q081\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q081\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q081\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Cost Explorer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q081\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">SQS visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-cost-explorer\">Cost Explorer</a>로 서비스와 기간별 비용 추세를 분석한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q098\" data-question=\"Q098\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q098</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q098/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a Compute Savings Plan but must also ensure that matching EC2 capacity is available in one specific Availability Zone for a launch. Which additional option should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A regional Reserved Instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Spot Fleet with no On-Demand capacity</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 사용 비용 할인이며 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">On-Demand Capacity Reservation</a>은 지정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·구성의 실행 용량을 확보한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>도 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">이전 용어 <b>AZ</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/\">다음 용어 <b>CloudFormation</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
